  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n5 - 5 ÷ 5 × 5 + (6 ÷ 6 of 6) × 6 - ( 3{2over 3} ÷ {11over 30} of 2over 3) ÷ 5\n\n⇒ 5 – 5 ÷ 5 × 5 + (6 ÷ 6 of 6) × 6 – (11/3 ÷ 11/30 of 2/3) ÷ 5\n\n⇒ 5 – 5 ÷ 5 × 5 + (6 ÷ 6 of 6) × 6 – (11/3 ÷ 11/45) ÷ 5\n\n⇒ 5 – 5 ÷ 5 × 5 + (6 ÷ 6 of 6) × 6 – (11/3 × 45/11) ÷ 5\n\n⇒ 5 – 5 ÷ 5 × 5 + (6 ÷ 6 of 6) × 6 – 15 ÷ 5\n\n⇒ 5 – 5 ÷ 5 × 5 + (6 ÷ 6 of 6) × 6 – 3\n\n⇒ 5 – 5 ÷ 5 × 5 + (6 ÷ 36) × 6 – 3\n\n⇒ 5 – 5 ÷ 5 × 5 + 1/6 × 6 – 3\n\n⇒ 5 – 5 ÷ 5 × 5 + 1 – 3\n\n⇒ 5 – 1 × 5 + (-2)\n\n⇒ 5 – 5 – 2\n\n⇒ 0 – 2\n\n⇒ -2\n\n**∴ The required value is -2**",
